  "description": "The native payload for Agora's voice effects and beautification extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_macOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for macOS. The voice changers, equalisation presets and room-reverb effects — the chipmunk voice, the concert-hall reverb, the \"studio\" polish on a plain microphone. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Mac or Net.Agora.Voice.Mac — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.SetVoiceBeautifierPreset / SetAudioEffectPreset in the RTC binding.",
